-- Lists of maps, by a Whose Key and by a key of `it` (ADR 0074).
script variable orders = [{id: 1, amount: 150 GBP, price: {currency: "GBP"}, paid: true}, {id: 2, amount: 80 GBP, price: {currency: "EUR"}, paid: false}, {id: 3, amount: 120 GBP, price: {currency: "GBP"}, paid: false}]

on big
 return every item of orders whose amount > 100 GBP
end big

on picks
 put the first item of orders whose it's paid is false into firstUnpaid
 put the last item of orders whose amount > 100 GBP into lastBig
 put the second item of orders whose price's currency is "GBP" into secondPounds
 return [the id of firstUnpaid, the id of lastBig, the id of secondPounds]
end picks
